# A jetsam kill rings the top bell AT ONCE, without the m5y sustain grace
# (banshee-yk8). A kill is a confirmed past event — the kernel already destroyed
# a process to survive — not a threshold spike that might recover, so the
# `red_grace_secs` guard that stops transient spikes escalating does not apply.
# Deleting the jetsam branch in `decide` drops a single FRESH red Jetsam (held 0s,
# severity a hair past red, not sustained, nowhere near the catastrophic ceiling)
# back through the ordinary ladder to Restless — where any other lone fresh red
# lands — so `a_single_jetsam_kill_shrieks_without_the_sustain_grace` fails.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/level.rs
test: a_single_jetsam_kill_shrieks_without_the_sustain_grace
---OLD---
    if reds.iter().any(|c| c.dimension == Dimension::Jetsam) {
        return Verdict {
            level: Level::Shrieking,
            source: dominant_source(&scoring),
        };
    }
